
metadata:
  book_id: "daeef"
  book_name: "Majmu'a Da'eef Ahadith"
  total_hadiths: "1508"
  available_languages: "ar,en,ur"
  intro: "A collection of narrations judged weak by the scholars, gathered for study and caution. Presented here in 1,500 of 1,508 numbered hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu; numbers 11, 305 and 1426-1432 are absent on the source site (withdrawn entries) and are skipped, original numbering preserved."
  intro_ar: "مجموعة من الأحاديث التي حكم عليها العلماء بالضعف، جُمعت للدراسة والحذر. تُعرض هنا في 1500 حديث بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "A collection of narrations judged weak by the scholars, gathered for study and caution. Presented here in 1,500 of 1,508 numbered hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu; numbers 11, 305 and 1426-1432 are absent on the source site (withdrawn entries) and are skipped, original numbering preserved."
  intro_ur: "علماء کی تحقیق میں ضعیف قرار دی گئی روایات کا مجموعہ، مطالعہ و احتیاط کے لیے۔ یہاں 1500 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "A collection of narrations judged weak by the scholars, gathered for study and caution. Presented here in 1,500 of 1,508 numbered hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu; numbers 11, 305 and 1426-1432 are absent on the source site (withdrawn entries) and are skipped, original numbering preserved."
